    - "分部积分公式是什么？" → "formula_lookup"\n                - "给我出5道概率题（高中水平）" → "generate"\n                - "数学界最近有什么新发现？" → "research"\n                - "解释一下 AM-GM 不等式及使用时机" → "explain"\n                - 在 explain 和 solve 之间拿不准时：如果没有具体数值题目 → "explain"\n\n                学生输入：\n                顶点公式是什么？请解释顶点公式。', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'deepseek-chat', 'max_completion_tokens': 2048, 'parallel_tool_calls': False, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.1, 'tool_choice': {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'IntentRouterOutput'}}, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'IntentRouterOutput', 'description': '', 'parameters': {'properties': {'topic': {'description': 'algebra | probability | calculus | linear_algebra | geometry | trigonometry | statistics | number_theory', 'type': 'string'}, 'difficulty': {'description': 'easy | medium | hard', 'type': 'string'}, 'solver_strategy': {'description': 'Best high-level strategy to solve this problem in 1-3 sentences', 'type': 'string'}, 'intent_type': {'default': 'solve', 'description': "The student's intent. One of:\n  solve          — full solve + verify pipeline (default for all problems)\n  explain        — student wants a concept explained, no new calculation needed\n  hint           — student wants a nudge, not a full solution\n  formula_lookup — student is asking for a formula or theorem statement only\n  research       — student wants info about recent/general math topics (no problem to solve)\n  generate       — student wants practice problems, examples, or content generated", 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['topic', 'difficulty', 'solver_strategy'], 'type': 'object'}}}]}}
